{"unit_id":"limochaishang__crash-guard-dsh#feature-1","repo":"limochaishang/crash-guard-dsh","commit":"51a771c1f5a2bf0259757154a6d4a4a0329cb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"crash-guard-dsh 的功能「启动崩溃隔离」：启动时读取上次状态；若停留在 booting，会将最后正在加载的插件追加到用户层 cordis.patch.yml 并标为 disabled。触发时机是插件下一次启动。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:338-375"]}
{"unit_id":"limochaishang__crash-guard-dsh#feature-2","repo":"limochaishang/crash-guard-dsh","commit":"51a771c1f5a2bf0259757154a6d4a4a0329cb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"crash-guard-dsh 的功能「插件加载卡顿检测」：启动期间追踪当前加载项，单个插件超过配置的 hang 超时后记录可疑项，以便后续启动隔离。默认超时为 15 秒。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:317-322"]}
